    "intent": "An app that acts as an expert children's director for a 3D animated YouTube Kids show starring Pip (lime-green baby T-Rex), Stella (orange Stegosaurus with colorful spots), and Toby (baby-blue Triceratops).\n\nInput:\n- Adventure topic (e.g., Camping under the stars) and Nursery Rhyme (e.g., Twinkle Twinkle Little Star).\n\nWorkflow & Output:\n1. 120-Second Story Arc (12 sequential 10-second scenes):\n   - Scene 1-3 (0-30s): Setting up the adventure & world exploration.\n   - Scene 4-6 (30-60s): Gentle preschool challenge & warm resolution.\n   - Scene 7-10 (60-100s): The core nursery rhyme singing sequence under the stars.\n   - Scene 11-12 (100-120s): Cozy conclusion, wind-down, and bedtime.\n2. Scene-by-Scene Breakdown:\n   - For every single scene (1 through 12), output:\n     - Exact timestamp (e.g., 0:10 - 0:20).\n     - Character Focus (Who is on screen).\n     - Visual Action & Background setting.\n     - Lyrics or Spoken Dialogue.\n3. 30-Second Short Extraction:\n   - Mark which 3 scenes (from 7-10) should be cropped to create the vertical 30-second teaser Short.",
